WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.715
"I can't go back to Magica!" Zann blurted out. "Not without finding my parents."

2
00:00:06.716 --> 00:00:10.093
"Don't be a fool, boy," Wyssa snapped.

3
00:00:10.094 --> 00:00:16.519
"I know I can find them," Zann retorted. "I even have a clue—World X.

4
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.178
I know my parents wanted to find it.

5
00:00:19.179 --> 00:00:22.979
Maybe that's where they are—they could be trapped there!"

6
00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:30.764
Wyssa looked startled. "How do you know about—never mind," she said, interrupting herself. "Yes,

7
00:00:30.765 --> 00:00:33.878
it's true they wanted to find World X. But

8
00:00:33.879 --> 00:00:36.490
I have no idea where it is. I

9
00:00:36.491 --> 00:00:42.850
promise I'll try to find out—after you and your friends are safely back in Magica." "That

10
00:00:42.851 --> 00:00:46.419
sounds like a good offer, Zann," Gliss said. Ignoring

11
00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:52.109
her, Zann glared at Wyssa. "They're my parents," he said. "Nobody

12
00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:56.082
cares about finding them as much as I do!" "I'm

13
00:00:56.083 --> 00:01:00.409
not so sure about that, boy," Wyssa muttered. "Morb

14
00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:04.876
is—" Once again she stopped herself. "Morb?"

15
00:01:04.877 --> 00:01:09.482
Perda spoke up. "What does he have to do with this?" "Forget

16
00:01:09.483 --> 00:01:12.257
it. I shouldn't have said anything." Wyssa

17
00:01:12.258 --> 00:01:16.037
stalked off toward the wormhole. "Let's go." "Not

18
00:01:16.038 --> 00:01:19.816
until you tell me what's going on," Zann said. "Why

19
00:01:19.817 --> 00:01:24.780
did you mention Morb? Is he looking for my parents too?" Wyssa

20
00:01:24.781 --> 00:01:30.011
scowled and then sighed. "I suppose you deserve to know. Maybe

21
00:01:30.012 --> 00:01:34.229
it will convince you not to rush off by yourself. Yes,

22
00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:40.058
I've heard rumors that Morb is looking for your parents. Nobody knows why." Zann

23
00:01:40.059 --> 00:01:45.176
froze. What could Morb possibly want with Zann's parents? "Hold

24
00:01:45.177 --> 00:01:49.691
on," Perda said. "How can Morb be searching for anyone? I

25
00:01:49.692 --> 00:01:54.289
thought he went back to being a Void when Zann defeated him." "I

26
00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:58.654
don't know how he's able to use the wormholes," Wyssa said. "But

27
00:01:58.655 --> 00:02:03.199
he's not keeping his search a secret." She grimaced. "He's

28
00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.059
left a trail of terrified worlds behind him." Perda's

29
00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:14.128
eyes widened. "That must be why the Skellians freaked out when we mentioned Morb's name!" "Whatever,"

30
00:02:14.129 --> 00:02:21.218
Zann said to Wyssa. "I'm still not going back to Magica." He

31
00:02:21.219 --> 00:02:25.349
rubbed both hands on his legs, hoping this spell would work. Touching

32
00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:29.702
the trunk of a sturdy tree, he cried, "Shackle!" It

33
00:02:29.703 --> 00:02:34.195
worked! Magical shackles appeared, binding Zann to the tree. Wyssa

34
00:02:34.196 --> 00:02:38.593
gnashed her teeth. "Stop this foolishness! Remove

35
00:02:38.594 --> 00:02:42.671
those shackles at once, or I'll do it for you." "You

36
00:02:42.672 --> 00:02:48.264
can't," Perda said. "Nobody can remove another person's Shackle spell." "She's

37
00:02:48.265 --> 00:02:52.555
right. And you won't change my mind," Zann said. "Take

38
00:02:52.556 --> 00:02:59.021
my friends home, and then we can search together. Otherwise I'll search on my own." "You

39
00:02:59.022 --> 00:03:04.563
don't know what you're doing, boy." Wyssa narrowed her eyes at Zann. "If

40
00:03:04.564 --> 00:03:11.922
even half the rumors about Morb's new powers are true, you won't have a chance against him." Zann

41
00:03:11.923 --> 00:03:18.141
stared at her. "You can't make me do anything," he said defiantly. "You

42
00:03:18.142 --> 00:03:21.453
didn't even know when Morb was tricking you!" "What

43
00:03:21.454 --> 00:03:24.321
are you talking about?" Wyssa demanded. "When

44
00:03:24.322 --> 00:03:31.176
you sent my parents off course with that scatter beast, it wasn't an accident," said Zann.

45
00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:36.140
"It was part of Morb's plan. He told me so himself."

46
00:03:36.141 --> 00:03:42.651
Wyssa's eyes went wide. "What?" Her yell echoed through the quiet forest.

47
00:03:42.652 --> 00:03:49.093
She leaped forward and touched Zann's forehead. "Truth!" she intoned.

48
00:03:49.094 --> 00:03:54.215
"Ow!" Zann yelped as he felt a sizzling sensation in his head.

49
00:03:54.216 --> 00:04:00.015
A second later Wyssa backed away, her eyes burning with rage.

50
00:04:00.016 --> 00:04:04.820
"So it is true," she said through gritted teeth.

51
00:04:04.821 --> 00:04:15.279
"I've been torturing myself all these years, thinking I was to blame for your parents' disappearance. Morb will pay for this!"

52
00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:23.741
Alarmed, Zann glanced at his friends. They were all staring at Wyssa in silence. Zing cowered behind Darb.

53
00:04:23.742 --> 00:04:27.841
Wyssa swept toward Zann again. "Release!" she said.

54
00:04:27.842 --> 00:04:32.990
The shackles exploded. Zann gasped. "How did you—"

55
00:04:32.991 --> 00:04:36.318
Before he could finish, Wyssa grabbed Gliss.

56
00:04:36.319 --> 00:04:39.737
"You're in charge now, Red," Wyssa said.

57
00:04:39.738 --> 00:04:43.732
"Take Zann and these others straight back to Magica."

58
00:04:43.733 --> 00:04:49.526
"I . . . I . . . ," Gliss stammered. She seemed too scared to speak.

59
00:04:49.527 --> 00:04:53.765
"This will ensure that you follow my orders, girl."

60
00:04:53.766 --> 00:04:56.576
Wyssa put her hands over Gliss' face.

61
00:04:56.577 --> 00:05:02.511
When the old woman pulled them away, glowing purple goggles covered Gliss' eyes.

62
00:05:02.512 --> 00:05:06.440
"Those goggles will show you the way," Wyssa said.

63
00:05:06.441 --> 00:05:10.676
"They'll also provide extra magic for navigating the vortex.

64
00:05:10.677 --> 00:05:19.741
But don't try to remove them until all of you are safely back in Magica, or you'll suffer intense pain."

65
00:05:19.742 --> 00:05:23.524
"I . . . I understand," Gliss said.

66
00:05:23.525 --> 00:05:33.265
"Good." Wyssa leaped for the wormhole. "Revenge will be mine!" she cried as she disappeared.

67
00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:38.860
"Wow," Perda said, her voice shaking. "That was scary!"

68
00:05:38.861 --> 00:05:42.595
Zann nodded, no longer doubting Wyssa's power.

69
00:05:42.596 --> 00:05:48.714
For a moment they all stayed quiet. "Maybe Wyssa is right," Zann thought.

70
00:05:48.715 --> 00:05:52.076
Maybe it was better to let her handle the search . . .

71
00:05:52.077 --> 00:05:57.135
Finally Gliss spoke up. "Zann, what do you want me to do?"

72
00:05:57.136 --> 00:06:02.764
Zann turned to her and sighed. "It's not like we have much choice."

73
00:06:02.765 --> 00:06:08.583
"There's always a choice." Gliss took a deep breath and reached for the goggles.

74
00:06:08.584 --> 00:06:10.851
"No!" Darb cried.

75
00:06:10.852 --> 00:06:13.984
"Gliss!" said Zann. "You don't have to—"

76
00:06:13.985 --> 00:06:18.213
"Aah!" cried Gliss, ripping the goggles from her face.

77
00:06:18.214 --> 00:06:22.938
She collapsed on the ground, writhing and crying out in pain.

78
00:06:22.939 --> 00:06:29.089
Darb rushed over to her. A minute later she was able to climb back to her feet.

79
00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:39.415
"Th—there," Gliss said. "If you want to continue your search, I won't stop you. In fact I'll come along."

80
00:06:39.416 --> 00:06:42.615
Perda looked at Zann. "We all will."

81
00:06:42.616 --> 00:06:46.339
Zann gulped. Putting himself in danger was one thing.

82
00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:49.962
But could he also risk his friends' lives again?

83
00:06:49.963 --> 00:06:52.424
"Are you sure?" he asked.

84
00:06:52.425 --> 00:06:57.480
Gliss, Perda, and Darb nodded. Zing let out an excited whistle.

85
00:06:57.481 --> 00:07:02.770
Zann suddenly felt braver. He and his friends had defeated Morb once before.

86
00:07:02.771 --> 00:07:07.070
They made a powerful team, the kind of team that could do anything.

87
00:07:07.071 --> 00:07:13.126
"Okay," he told them. "Let's go!"

